Package: wfdbx
Type: Package
Title: Read and Write Physiologic Signal and Annotation Files (WFDB)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("George B.", "Moody", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "original C library and tools (WFDB Software Package)"),
    person("Benjamin", "Moody", role = "aut",
           comment = "revisions of the original C library and tools, 2010-2022, including FLAC support"),
    person("Edna S.", "Moody", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "original C code of parsescp, with George B. Moody"),
    person("T.", "Baker", role = "aut",
           comment = "original C code of ecgcodes.h and rdann, with George B. Moody"),
    person("Luca", "Citi", role = "ctb",
           comment = "bug fix and -x option of the original rdedfann"),
    person("Reza", "Sameni", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "reza.sameni@gmail.com",
           comment = "the R implementation (wfdb-x)"))
Description: The R implementation of wfdb-x, a reimplementation in pure R
    of the WFDB Software Package 10.7.0 (the library and its command-line
    tools) for the physiologic signal, annotation and header files used by
    PhysioNet. It reads and writes the same files as the original C
    implementation, and its tools produce byte-identical output.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/alphanumericslab/wfdb-x
BugReports: https://github.com/alphanumericslab/wfdb-x/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: tools
Encoding: UTF-8
ByteCompile: true
NeedsCompilation: no
